==Quotes==
We are the Pellars, an order of faithful guardians of the land and its children. Healers, shepherds and teachers.

We see beyond the mirages of politics to aid those in Gilneas who find refuge in the old ways. Farmers, huntsmen, humble folk who did not lose their true self in the groves of cold stone.

Join us, return to your roots.

